<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu rises to 4.6002 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu rises to 4.6002 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu rose to 4.6002 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange on Tuesday from 4.6212 last Thursday.</p>
<p>					 Oct 1		   Sept 26</p>
<p>    lei per dollar		 4.6002		  4.6212</p>
<p>    volume traded ($)	    800,000		 30,000</p>
<p>					 Oct 1		   Sept 25</p>
<p>    lei per 1,000 roubles	0.8470		  0.8515</p>
<p>    volume traded (R million)  100		     50</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
